#: ../../12-document.md:1 d3cd43fa4575443d8c52e13e2f1a2197
msgid "12. Documentation Process"
msgstr "12. 文档流程"

#: ../../12-document.md:5 b7eb54e860c949b1bc9fa267f7cb79d7
msgid ""
"How this Project Knowledge Base is authored, refreshed, translated, and "
"published. Operator configuration stays in the [FreeSWITCH Users "
"Manual](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/) — this PKB does not "
"replace it. Historical wiki: [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) and [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/). Pipeline "
"commands for Autotools/CI live in [Build](08-build.md); this page is the PKB"
" maintenance contract."
msgstr ""
"本项目知识库如何撰写、刷新、翻译与发布。运维配置以 [FreeSWITCH "
"用户手册](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/) 为准 — 本 PKB 并不取代它。历史 "
"wiki：[FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) 与 [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/)。Autotools/CI "
"的流水线命令见 [构建](08-build.md)；本页是 PKB 维护契约。"

#: ../../12-document.md:7 e8cb7a846a6b48cf89a8107933f955f2
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../12-document.md:9 1dc77970ffac4c45bbbdc55431286cfc
msgid ""
"Keep a bilingual, AI-readable map of **this git tree** so humans and "
"assistants can locate code, understand architecture, and verify changes. "
"English MyST under `man/` is the working source. Deterministic scripts "
"refresh facts into `man/_generated/`. Humans (with targeted AI) merge those "
"facts into numbered pages `00`–`12`. Sphinx HTML and AgentBox are derived "
"outputs."
msgstr ""
"为 **本 git 树** 保留一份双语、可供 AI 阅读的地图，方便人和助手定位代码、理解架构并核对变更。`man/` 下的英文 MyST "
"是工作源。确定性脚本把事实刷新到 `man/_generated/`。人类（配合定向 AI）把这些事实合并进编号页面 `00`–`12`。Sphinx "
"HTML 和 AgentBox 是派生输出。"

#: ../../12-document.md:11 8d4a3800d5d947c4ab09893386743a56
msgid ""
"`PKB_ROOT` is **`man/` at the repo root**. `docs/man/` is Unix man-page "
"source (`freeswitch.1.ronn`), not the PKB."
msgstr ""
"`PKB_ROOT` 是 **仓库根目录下的 `man/`**。`docs/man/` 是 Unix man page "
"源（`freeswitch.1.ronn`），不是 PKB。"

