"follows catalogs + English. AgentBox follows stripped HTML."
msgstr "**规则：** 先改英文 Markdown。目录跟随英文。HTML 跟随目录 + 英文。AgentBox 跟随剥离后的 HTML。"

#: ../../12-document.md:30 5e47a129ff8748e5a417fa7d602db8ad
msgid "Advisory Update Loop"
msgstr "建议更新循环"

#: ../../12-document.md:32 7df13302a5ce4e96b0d1ec3e5fccb2bd
msgid "Code, Autotools, CI, or XML-config changes land in the repo."
msgstr "代码、Autotools、CI 或 XML 配置变更合入仓库。"

#: ../../12-document.md:33 4c291d7c880b45b0bed9f2c218c5ce17
msgid ""
"Run `cd man && make pkb-check` (`scripts/check_pkb_staleness.py`). "
"Optionally `make pkb-check-i18n` once `.po` files exist."
msgstr ""
"运行 `cd man && make pkb-check`（`scripts/check_pkb_staleness.py`）。一旦存在 `.po` "
"文件，可再跑 `make pkb-check-i18n`。"

#: ../../12-document.md:34 7982240df09b4d1fb0a6f376dcd2a44f
msgid ""
"A human decides which English PKB pages need a refresh this PR / sprint (do "
"not regenerate everything)."
msgstr "由人决定本 PR / 迭代需要刷新哪些英文 PKB 页面（不要整套重生成）。"

#: ../../12-document.md:35 930bfd5b065b46549b01e338f47386f9
msgid ""
"Run Level 1 scripts first (`make pkb-level1`). Merge facts from "
"`_generated/` into the affected human pages. Use a targeted LLM pass only "
"for Level 2 synthesis (diff + those pages + the sidecar artifacts — not the "
"whole tree)."
msgstr ""
"先跑 Level 1 脚本（`make pkb-level1`）。把 `_generated/` 里的事实合并进受影响的人工页面。Level 2 "
"综合只用定向 LLM（diff + 那些页面 + 附属产物 — 不是整棵树）。"

#: ../../12-document.md:36 f1e8ae89fb8644aca3fde7763663e3d5
msgid ""
"Stamp the metadata footer (`last_updated`, `commit`, `updated_by`). Leave "
"`review_status: pending` unless a human is approving."
msgstr ""
"盖上元数据页脚（`last_updated`、`commit`、`updated_by`）。除非人类正在批准，否则保持 `review_status: "
"pending`。"

#: ../../12-document.md:37 f839edbbd1f24aa3898a042103cd1931
msgid ""
"After English wording changes: generate/update gettext catalogs (planned "
"until the first `intl-update` run), then rebuild HTML."
msgstr "英文措辞变更后：生成/更新 gettext 目录（在第一次 `intl-update` 之前仍属计划），然后重建 HTML。"

#: ../../12-document.md:38 c2b9c66f24894ef6a9e26932f8c31f90
msgid ""
"A human reviews (`make pkb-review-status`) before any AgentBox publish."
msgstr "任何 AgentBox 发布前，由人评审（`make pkb-review-status`）。"

