"matching `_generated/` artifact. Do not dump `src/` or `src/mod/`."
msgstr ""
"只把 git diff、受影响的 `man/*.md` 页面，以及对应的 `_generated/` 产物喂给模型。不要倾倒 `src/` 或 "
"`src/mod/`。"

#: ../../12-document.md 93cce8555a3946d880c38444c92f2e84
msgid "Tiered updates"
msgstr "分层更新"

#: ../../12-document.md 650ae2c6b0ad44cca010d65db06dbc79
msgid ""
"Level 1 = scripts. Level 2 = bounded LLM merge. Level 3 = human rationale "
"(ADR, product intent)."
msgstr "Level 1 = 脚本。Level 2 = 有边界的 LLM 合并。Level 3 = 人类理由（ADR、产品意图）。"

#: ../../12-document.md 7856b8c7e6034208b899cd327da7e288
msgid "Batch instead of thrash"
msgstr "批量更新，避免反复折腾"

#: ../../12-document.md 1c0bbd08618e496883fe2402e65a5698
msgid ""
"Refresh per PR, sprint, or release — not after every FreeSWITCH commit. This"
" history is large."
msgstr "按 PR、迭代或发版刷新 — 不要每个 FreeSWITCH 提交都刷。这段历史很长。"

#: ../../12-document.md:49 b79808817544417f8a8810df887ee576
msgid "Deterministic Script Toolbox"
msgstr "确定性脚本工具箱"

#: ../../12-document.md:51 94a0242077a944f8be5c8b33e4627d22
msgid ""
"All paths below exist under `man/scripts/`. There is **no** in-tree "
"`init_pkb.sh` (that helper lives in the PKB skill and already ran at "
"scaffold time)."
msgstr ""
"下列路径都在 `man/scripts/` 下。仓库内 **没有** `init_pkb.sh`（该助手在 PKB skill 里，脚手架时已经跑过）。"

#: ../../12-document.md:53 be82eadfc0424f1ab63ae22f5d6348d2
msgid ""
"Scripts write sidecar files under `man/_generated/` with an `<!-- Auto-"
"generated by … -->` header. They **must not** overwrite human-maintained "
"pages (`00-overview.md` … `12-document.md`, `index.md`, appendices). "
"Inferred meaning stays as `[NEEDS INPUT: …]`."
msgstr ""
"脚本把附属文件写到 `man/_generated/`，带 `<!-- Auto-generated by … -->` 头。它们 **不得** "
"覆盖人工维护的页面（`00-overview.md` … `12-document.md`、`index.md`、附录）。推断出的含义保持 "
"`[NEEDS INPUT: …]`。"

