#: ../../12-document.md:77 647a44276bf44e76b85823d04525fa6c
msgid "Three-Level Update Policy"
msgstr "三级更新策略"

#: ../../12-document.md:79 261fa5ebac7e4edcbaa3fbd006df3b47
msgid ""
"**Level 1 — Automatic (zero token):** tree snapshots, Sphinx-dep inventory, "
"index candidate, staleness/i18n reports, changelog draft, confidential "
"strip, AgentBox `files.ts`. Run `make pkb-level1` (and the specific script "
"if you only need one artifact). Stop if the sidecar is enough for a "
"mechanical merge (path rename, version bump)."
msgstr ""
"**Level 1 — 自动（零 token）：** 树快照、Sphinx 依赖盘点、index 候选、过期/i18n 报告、changelog "
"草稿、密级剥离、AgentBox `files.ts`。跑 `make pkb-"
"level1`（若只要一件产物则跑对应脚本）。若附属产物已足够做机械合并（路径改名、版本号），就停。"

#: ../../12-document.md:80 80bae3db44084337800fb1d8cc33b074
msgid ""
"**Level 2 — LLM-assisted:** new/removed modules, ESL/event contract wording,"
" build/CI narrative, workflow traces. Handoff package: git diff + the "
"published page(s) + only the relevant `_generated/` files (for example "
"`04-repo-map.generated.md` into [Repository Map](04-repo-map.md), `03-tech-"
"stack.generated.md` into [Tech Stack](03-tech-stack.md), changelog draft "
"into [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) / [Build](08-build.md)). Set `review_status: "
"pending` after a substantive rewrite."
msgstr ""
"**Level 2 — LLM 辅助：** 新增/删除模块、ESL/事件契约措辞、构建/CI 叙述、工作流追踪。交接包：git diff + 已发布页面"
" + 仅相关 `_generated/` 文件（例如把 `04-repo-map.generated.md` 合进 [仓库地图](04-repo-"
"map.md)，把 `03-tech-stack.generated.md` 合进 [技术栈](03-tech-stack.md)，把 "
"changelog 草稿合进 [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) / [构建](08-build.md)）。实质性改写后设 "
"`review_status: pending`。"

#: ../../12-document.md:81 21da43a43dbd4ff1a47deded05681363
msgid ""
"**Level 3 — Human-led:** ADRs (`man/adr/`; none recorded yet beyond the "
"template), change proposals (`man/changes/`), product direction, “why we "
"load this module.” AI formats and cross-links; it does not invent rationale."
msgstr ""
"**Level 3 — 人类主导：** "
"ADR（`man/adr/`；除模板外尚未记录）、变更提案（`man/changes/`）、产品方向、“我们为什么加载这个模块”。AI "
"负责排版和交叉链接；不编造理由。"

